    "description": "There’s no better comfort food than southern comfort food. In this video, Nicole shows you how to make chicken fried steak. First, after flattening out the steaks, whisk together some baking powder, baking soda, pepper, and salt. Now, combine the mixture with buttermilk, egg, hot sauce, and garlic to make the batter. Drudge and cover both sides of the steaks with flour and batter before frying in the pan of vegetable shortening oil. After the steaks finish frying, make sure to save some fat and solid remnants to whip up some gravy. Pour the gravy and enjoy this southern recipe!",
